  },
  en:{
    hero_eyebrow:"H+ Therapy Companion",
    hero_h1:"Your personal, digital companion for your treatment.",
    hero_p:"We deliver your medication free of charge straight to your door, remind you of every upcoming dose and keep track of your doctor’s appointments for you – so you can focus entirely on your health.",
    hero_c1:"✓ No payment details — the Companion is free",
    hero_c2:"✓ No health data required to register",
    hero_c3:"✓ Cancel or delete your account at any time",
    hero_tie:"Did you receive the leaflet with your medication? Complete your free registration here in just a few minutes.",
    benefits_title:"Your benefits at a glance",
    ben_rem_t:"Reminder service", ben_rem_d:"Personalised reminders throughout your therapy.",
    ben_rx_t:"Prescription support", ben_rx_d:"Support coordinating your repeat prescriptions.",
    ben_term_t:"Appointment scheduling", ben_term_d:"Help planning the check-ups your treatment requires.",
    ben_hot_t:"Patient hotline", ben_hot_d:"Support with any general questions about your treatment.",
    ben_info_t:"Educational material", ben_info_d:"Helpful learning content about your therapy.",
    ben_hub_t:"Everything in one place", ben_hub_d:"Your personal service area, available whenever you need it.",
    contact_h:"Questions? We're here for you.", contact_hours:" · Mon–Fri, 08:00–18:00",
    disclaimer:"The H+ Therapy Companion is a voluntary, free support service from Healthcare Deutschland GmbH and does not replace advice from your doctor or pharmacist. Taking part has no effect on your medical treatment.",
    err_phone:"Please enter a valid German or Austrian phone number.", err_whatsapp_global:"Please enter a valid international WhatsApp number including its country code.", err_email_fmt:"Please enter a valid email address.", err_required:"Please complete this field.",
    next_title:"What happens next",
    nxt1_t:"Confirmation by email", nxt1_d:"You'll shortly receive an email confirming all the details you provided.",
    nxt2_t:"We arrange everything for you", nxt2_d:"If you have provided the necessary details, the H+ team will arrange everything directly with your doctor and pharmacy. Once all the details are confirmed, we'll be in touch to explain the next steps.", nxt2_pill:"Takes up to 48 hours",
    nxt3_t:"You will receive notifications from us", nxt3_d:"In the meantime, you'll keep receiving notifications — based on the preferences you selected.",
    trust1:"✓ Free to use", trust2:"✓ GDPR-compliant", trust3:"✓ Can be cancelled at any time", trust4:"✓ Expert support",
    step1_name:"General information", step2_name:"Your medication", step3_name:"Your service modules", step4_name:"Confirm",
    s1_title:"Tell us about yourself", s1_sub:"This helps us set up your H+ Therapy Companion just for you.",
    role_label:"Are you the patient or the caregiver?", opt_select:"Please select…", opt_patient:"Patient", opt_caregiver:"Caregiver",
    firstname_label:"First name", lastname_label:"Last name", email_label:"Email address",
    email_reassure:"We use your email only for your H+ Therapy Companion — never for third-party marketing.",
    comm_label:"How should we contact the patient with our reminder service?",
    opt_email:"Email", opt_whatsapp:"WhatsApp", opt_phone:"Phone call", opt_sms:"SMS",
    whatsapp_label:"WhatsApp number", phone_label:"Phone number", sms_label:"SMS number",
    second_label:"Would you like medication reminders sent to a caregiver as well?",
    opt_yes:"Yes", opt_no:"No",
    sc_first:"First name", sc_last:"Last Name",
    rel_label:"What is this person's relationship to the patient?",
    rel_parent:"Parent", rel_grand:"Grandparent", rel_sib:"Sibling", rel_partner:"Partner / Spouse", rel_friend:"Friend", rel_prof:"Professional caregiver",
    cg_comm_label:"How should we contact this person?",
    sc_email:"Email", sc_whatsapp:"WhatsApp number", sc_phone:"Phone number", sc_sms:"SMS number",
    create_acct:"Create an account", create_acct_sub:"We recommend a free account to manage all services in one place.",
    terms_html:'I agree to the <a href="/therapy-companion/terms-and-conditions" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:#007EC6;text-decoration:underline">Terms &amp; Conditions</a> and have read the <a href="/therapy-companion/privacy-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:#007EC6;text-decoration:underline">Privacy Policy</a>.',
    next_med:"Continue to your medication →",
    err_select:"Please make a selection.", err_first:"Please enter a first name.", err_last:"Please enter a last name.",
    err_email:"Please enter a valid email address.", err_comm:"Please select at least one contact method.", err_terms:"Please agree to the terms to continue.",
    s2_title:"Confirm your medication", s2_sub:"Please check the details of your prescription.",
    med_q:"Which medication were you prescribed?", med_h:"Medication details", med_name_l:"Name", med_dose_l:"Dose", med_dose_v:"25 mg film-coated tablet", med_freq_l:"Frequency", med_freq_v:"One tablet daily", med_admin_l:"Administration", med_admin_v:"Oral",
    confirm_med:"I confirm that the above medication was prescribed to me at these doses.", err_confirm:"Please confirm your prescription.",
    firstdate_label:"When was your first dose taken?", err_date:"Please provide a date.",
    other_med_label_html:'Does the patient take any other medication? <span style="font-weight:400;color:#71777C">(please provide details)</span>',
    other_med_ph:"e.g. name, dose … or “none”",
    freq_label:"How often would you like us to check in?",
    freq_h:"Regular check-ins",
    freq_para:"Regular check-ins help make sure you're taking your medicine correctly and always know everything you need to. We recommend weekly check-ins to start.",
    freq_weekly:"Weekly", freq_weekly_sub:"Recommended especially at the start", freq_2w:"Every two weeks", freq_monthly:"Monthly", err_freq:"Please choose a frequency.",
    next_delivery:"Continue to delivery and pick up service →", back:"← Back", next_generic:"Continue →", to_review:"Continue to summary →", or_word:"or",
    sub_of:"Step %s of 3",
    s3_title:"How can we support you?", s3_sub:"Below, you can select the modules from our range of services that will make your day-to-day life with your treatment easier.",
    country_label:"Which country do you live in?", country_de:"Germany", country_at:"Austria", err_country:"Please select your country.",
    support_label:"How can we help you?",
    delivery_h:"Delivery and pick up service",
    delivery_para:"Treatments for chronic conditions are often expensive and not always widely available. We take care of the coordination for you and deliver your medicines reliably straight to your doorstep – at the right time, in the right quantity. This ensures your medication is ready when you need it.",
    delivery_opt:"Yes, I would like to use the free delivery and pick up service",
    rx_h:"Prescription Coordination",
    rx_para:"A missing prescription can lead to a disruption in your treatment. We monitor your medication stock in line with your treatment plan and coordinate follow-up prescriptions with your doctor in good time. This ensures your treatment continues without interruption and minimises the administrative effort involved in obtaining prescriptions.",
    rx_opt:"Yes, I would like to have help arranging my prescription automatically.",
    checkup_h:"Appointment reminders",
    checkup_para:"Regular check-up appointments are essential to ensure your treatment progresses smoothly. We keep track of your upcoming doctor’s appointments and remind you in good time – so you’ll never miss an important check-up again.",
    checkup_opt:"Yes, please remind me of my appointments",
    delivery_notice:"To ensure the delivery and pick up service runs smoothly, we also need your consent to obtain your repeat prescription from your treating doctor. Please select the option below as well.",
    delivery_req_note:"If you would like to use our delivery and pick up service, you must also allow us to manage your prescription. Please select this option too.",
    nosupport_t:"I don't need any support right now.",
    err_options:"Please select at least one option.",
    s3b_title:"Your consent", s3b_sub:"One click is all it takes — and you can withdraw your consent at any time.",
    consent_delivery:"I agree that H+ may process my personal data to source and deliver my medication.",
    consent_hcp:"I authorise H+ (Healthcare Deutschland GmbH) to contact my doctor to arrange my repeat prescriptions.",
    consent_page_h:"Consent",
    consent_page_intro:"In order for us to provide the services you have selected, we need your consent to the following.",
    consent_delivery_title:"Free delivery and pick up service",
    consent_hcp_title:"Free Management and help with your Repeat Prescriptions",
    consent_read_tc:"Please read the terms and conditions below.", consent_terms_link:"Read the delivery and pick up service terms", hcp_terms_link:"Read the prescription coordination terms",
    agree_delivery:"I have read and agree to the delivery and pick up service terms.",
    agree_hcp:"I have read and agree to the prescription consent above.",
    consent_hcp_germany:'I commission and authorize [CARE SERVICE] (hereinafter “the care service”) to request, on my behalf, <strong>follow-up or repeat prescriptions for my long-term medication</strong> from my treating physician(s) and to arrange for their issuance.<br><br>For this purpose, I consent to the care service processing the data required for this and transmitting it to the relevant doctor’s practice, in particular: first and last name, date of birth, address, insurance data, details of the required medication (medication plan), and the contact details of the doctor’s practice.<br><br>To the extent necessary, I <strong>release the named physicians from their duty of medical confidentiality</strong> vis-à-vis the care service, limited to the purpose of requesting and processing follow-up prescriptions.<br><br>This consent is voluntary. I may <strong>revoke it at any time with effect for the future</strong> without suffering any disadvantage as a result; my nursing care remains unaffected. The lawfulness of processing carried out up to the point of revocation remains unaffected.',
    consent_delivery_germany:'For this purpose, I consent to the care service transmitting the required data to the pharmacy chosen by me, or arranging such transmission, in particular: name, delivery address, prescription details, and, where applicable, contact details for queries and delivery.<br><br><strong>Note on the e-prescription:</strong> For electronic prescriptions, assignment to the chosen pharmacy is primarily carried out by me myself (e.g. via the e-prescription app, the electronic health card, or a paper printout with prescription code). The care service does not transmit access data for e-prescriptions (“tokens”) via insecure channels.<br><br>I agree that the chosen pharmacy may deliver the medicines to my delivery address, provided it offers a corresponding courier/delivery service.<br><br>This consent is voluntary and may be revoked at any time with effect for the future; no disadvantages arise as a result.',
    consent_hcp_austria:'I commission and authorize [CARE SERVICE] (hereinafter “the care service”) to request, on my behalf, <strong>follow-up or long-term prescriptions (e-prescription) for my long-term medication</strong> from my treating physician and to arrange for their issuance.<br><br>For this purpose, I consent to the care service processing the required data and transmitting it to the doctor’s practice, in particular: first and last name, date of birth, address, social insurance number, details of the required medication, and the contact details of the practice.<br><br>To the extent necessary, I <strong>release the named physician from the duty of medical confidentiality (§ 54 ÄrzteG 1998)</strong> vis-à-vis the care service, limited to the purpose of requesting and processing follow-up prescriptions.<br><br>This consent is voluntary and may be revoked at any time with effect for the future, without any disadvantage to me; my nursing care remains unaffected. The lawfulness of processing carried out up to the point of revocation remains unaffected.',
    consent_delivery_austria:'In Austria, shipping prescription-only medicines is prohibited (§ 59 (8) AMG). So that I can nevertheless receive my medications conveniently, I <strong>commission and authorize the care service to collect my medications at the local pharmacy chosen by me and deliver them to me</strong>. This is a collection by a person authorized by me (courier service) – not shipping by the pharmacy; dispensing takes place, as usual, at the pharmacy.',
    freechoice_h:"Free choice of pharmacy",
    freechoice_p:"You have the right to choose your pharmacy freely (§ 31 (1) SGB V). The partner pharmacy named below is merely a non-binding offer. You are not obliged to use it and may name a different pharmacy or switch pharmacies at any time – without any disadvantage.",
    freechoice_h_at:"Free choice of pharmacy in Austria",
    freechoice_p_at:"You may choose your pharmacy freely. The partner pharmacy below is a non-binding option. You may select a different pharmacy for the delivery and pick up service at any time, without disadvantage.",
    pharmacy_q:"I request that my prescription be forwarded to the following pharmacy for dispensing, or that such forwarding be arranged:",
    pharmacy_hplus:"H+ pharmacy – delivery and pick up service",
    pharma_badge:"Recommended",
    pharma_feat_delivery:"Delivery and pick up service within 48 hours",
    pharma_feat_stock:"Brinsupri in stock",
    altpm_title:"Are you sure?",
